OL,3,GNEWSAHow to spot a psychopath at work -
OL,4,Afrom a man who worried he could be one
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I had to really become a kind of worse
OL,7,Fversion of myself in order to thrive in
OL,8,Fthis environment," he said.
